If you won't need to take it off, you could wear some of the gear you
found while it's still cursed (i.e. if you found a SDSM).  In any case,
picking it all up and then reading a blessed scroll of remove curse
will fix everything, and you can always do one item at a time with
uncursed remove curse if you can't find the blessed scroll.

Assuming you have magic marker charges remaining, if it comes to #3 you
should wish for 2 blessed scrolls of genocide; that way, you can write
the cursed scrolls and have L and h off your case as an added bonus.
If it were me, I'd be burning the wish (unless there's some other easy
way out I don't see) because I'd feel dumber dying in the Quest or
similar with a magic lamp in my inventory than dying for reasons
unrelated to this problem later on, without any such obvious way out
sitting in my inventory.

Good luck with whatever method you try!

